      "value": "@{5c0b6d3fbb15270c48b56338|full_name} Well, I don't know why the bug occurs, but I know it used to work properly in VR before.\n\nThe workaround I found is to get stuck in a collider; where you see yourself 3rd person, and move your head around until you get your HUD position in the spot you want it.",
