  "details": "Unable to reposition the radial menu using the \"HUD Position\" option when radial menu in On HUD in VR.\n\n-Open Radial Menu\n\n-Navigate through Options>Config \n\n-Make sure \"On Hud\" is checked\n\n-Select \"HUD Position\"\n\n-Now you are unable to move the HUD\n\nShowcase of issue: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pdYKSBXD8EU",
